Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.09,0:00:04.72,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}STUDENT COUNCIL OFFICE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:07.57,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Our first sports day since \Ngoing co-ed is coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.57,0:00:11.78,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Let's make sure all committees work \Ntogether to make this a smooth process.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.23,0:00:15.27,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Check the documents I've shared \Nwith you for details.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.27,0:00:17.41,Main,COUNCIL BOY A,0,0,0,,Uh, Vice President Uzuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.77,0:00:21.08,Main,COUNCIL BOY A,0,0,0,,Why is your selfie among these documents?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.34,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,No! I messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:24.55,Main,COUNCIL GIRL A,0,0,0,,I have one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.43,0:00:30.22,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,This is embarrassing, \Nso please just put them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:33.57,Italics,COUNCIL BOY AB,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I joined the student council.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.57,0:00:36.47,Main,COUNCIL GIRL B,0,0,0,,I'll be collecting those documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:38.64,Main,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Vice President.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:40.86,Main,BOY 1,0,0,0,,I want to discuss the gymnasium schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:43.25,Main,GIRL 1,0,0,0,,Shinobu-chan, help me with homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.25,0:00:45.40,Main,GIRL 2,0,0,0,,Uzuki-san, we have \Na meeting for sports day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.40,0:00:48.07,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Right. So, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.07,0:00:50.68,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,Vice President Uzuki's \Nalways surrounded by people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.68,0:00:52.01,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Are you surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.01,0:00:55.40,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,She's pretty, smart, and most of all...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:58.30,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Her voice is as lovely as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:02.21,Main,GIRL 3,0,0,0,,Sorry, Shinobu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.21,0:01:05.69,Main,GIRL 4,0,0,0,,There were apparently some errors \Nin the sports day application.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:07.98,Main,GIRL 4,0,0,0,,Now we have to rewrite it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:11.17,Main,GIRL 3,0,0,0,,But we can't tell what's wrong with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.83,0:01:15.56,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:16.99,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'll fix it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:19.56,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,That's our Shinobu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.06,0:01:25.38,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Great. I'm gonna be stuck here till dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.95,0:01:29.28,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Why do I always act like I can do it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.96,0:01:33.74,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Things are going to get hectic here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:42.96,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}PREPARING FOR SPORTS DAY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:37.47,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It's that time of year again. \NSports day is coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.47,0:01:42.96,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We'll provide commentary, score updates, \Nand emcee announcements on the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:46.90,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We'll also handle all setup \Nof the audio equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.90,0:01:49.55,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,In a way, the broadcasting club \Nwill be the stars behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.55,0:01:53.52,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The stars, huh? \NThat gets my blood pumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.40,0:01:57.93,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You'll be setting \Nthe equipment up, errand boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:02:01.14,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We'll need a point \Nof contact for the clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:03.26,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:05.91,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm on the student council, \Nso that'll make it easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.91,0:02:10.28,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We'll also need a script and schedule \Nfor the emcee announcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.99,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Who's going to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:14.72,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Iko and I did that last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:18.81,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,We messed up and left the table tennis \Nteam without any commentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:27.96,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}<JOBS FOR SPORTS DAY>
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.81,0:02:20.62,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'll do that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:23.25,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Next, we'll need a scorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.25,0:02:25.02,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I can't do math!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.02,0:02:26.20,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:28.28,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I-I can do that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.85,0:02:34.09,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Are you sure, Shinobu? \NIsn't that too much work?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.09,0:02:35.93,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We can't ask you to do everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:39.08,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,No problem. Just leave it all to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:40.45,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,May I say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.02,0:02:44.56,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why don't we put on an event of our own?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:46.81,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Something that's very broadcasting-like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.56,0:02:50.32,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That sounds great. What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:51.67,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:53.60,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Let's do a maid café.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:55.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Casting a very broad net there, \Nbut not broadcasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.43,0:02:56.61,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Announce the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.61,0:02:57.98,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Too basic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:03:00.78,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Maybe rent out the clubroom \Nas storage space?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:02.65,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Quit trying to run a business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:05.77,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,How about reciting the \NYamabuki family's glorious history?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.77,0:03:09.38,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's a law out there \Nbanning sleep-inducing broadcasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:10.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Uzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.71,0:03:12.41,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Don't you have any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.41,0:03:17.10,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Nope. I'll just put all your ideas \Ntogether and make a pitch deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:23.56,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone try to come up \Nwith ideas by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.56,0:03:24.98,Main,NENEIKO,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.98,0:03:26.68,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Now, what say we go to karaoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:27.65,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.65,0:03:31.23,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. I still have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.23,0:03:32.57,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Do you need help?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.03,0:03:35.28,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:36.99,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I can handle this much myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.99,0:03:39.66,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Yeah? See you, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.66,0:03:41.65,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yep, bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.65,0:03:43.23,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.23,0:03:45.58,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I made a list of songs I wanna sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.58,0:03:46.67,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:49.63,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I went and acted \Nlike I can do it all again...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.63,0:03:50.88,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:53.36,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Wh-What's the matter, Yamabuki-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:03:57.63,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.58,0:04:01.76,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:03.64,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:05.55,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Come with me, Uzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:14.17,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:18.13,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Do you swear you won't tell \Na soul what I'm about to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.13,0:04:20.36,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I-I-I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:23.27,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What? Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:26.13,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,If he wants to keep it secret, \Ndoes that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:28.86,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}ADDITIVE-FREE COUGH DROP
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.52,0:04:30.48,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:31.79,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A cough drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:34.00,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your voice sounds off today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:36.41,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Take it. Maybe you'll feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.51,0:04:39.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,However!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:43.44,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Nobody can know that \NI brought cough drops to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.44,0:04:45.48,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,They're counted as snacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:49.48,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,and yours truly cannot be known \Nfor breaking school rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:53.84,Flashback Italics,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Her voice is as lovely as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:57.67,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:04:59.11,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.99,0:05:04.24,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that you \Ncould tell I sound different.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:08.28,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But of course. I'm always watching you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:09.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,and listening to your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:13.55,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's my duty as the club's leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.25,0:05:15.75,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:19.49,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,O-Oh, you're always watching me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.49,0:05:21.65,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Then I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:23.93,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I should take better care \Nof my appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:26.22,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Uzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:28.99,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You seem to be biting off \Nmore than you can chew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.65,0:05:32.98,Main,UZUKI,0,0,0,,This is just how I've always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:40.75,Main,UZUKI,0,0,0,,I want to play a model student—\Neverybody's trusted vice president.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.75,0:05:46.16,Main,UZUKI,0,0,0,,I guess I want to hear everyone tell me \Nhow amazing and cool I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:49.22,Main,UZUKI,0,0,0,,Wait, what am I even saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:52.30,Main,UZUKI,0,0,0,,Sorry, forget you heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:56.00,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I see. So you want \Nto bask in the spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.71,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Hey, don't put it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:05:58.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Sure enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:02.30,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A smart, beautiful vice president \Nwho wants to be an anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:04.09,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That is a lot of prestige.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:07.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Everyone constantly has \Nhigh expectations of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:09.22,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,so it comes with a lot of pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:13.54,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But you can rejoice, \Nbecause that ends today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:19.07,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,After all, a being far more \N"amazing and cool" than yourself—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:20.56,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,yes, indeed—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:23.45,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,yours truly is here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:27.48,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Everyone will be putting their \Nexpectations on me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:31.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say that the spotlight \Nshall shine on me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.63,0:06:35.99,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,So, Uzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.97,0:06:40.55,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Don't try to live up \Nto everyone's hopes all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.55,0:06:42.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rely on others more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:45.07,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Actually, rely on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:47.80,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,There is nobody more capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.18,0:06:51.22,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're too much of a goody-two-shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.73,0:06:54.24,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,How about you try unwinding \Nevery now and then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.11,0:06:58.71,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:04.53,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:09.95,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Why don't you and I unwind right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.95,0:07:12.95,Main,EPTITLEA SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}ALL ALONE WITH YOU UNTIL DARK
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:47.76,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}LIBRARY
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:47.76,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.40,0:08:52.26,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Close your eyes, and don't \Nopen them until I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:55.34,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You'd better not to be trying \Nto do anything weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.34,0:08:56.43,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:08:58.89,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm just unwinding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:00.81,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Unwinding how?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:01.77,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:03.68,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Alarm, alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:08.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Uzuki! Did you just try \Nto feed me chocolate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.41,0:09:12.06,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:18.25,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,This is how I unwind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.74,0:09:23.61,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Snacking in secret while doing \Nstudent council work is what I live for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.61,0:09:25.00,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:26.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,but that's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.93,0:09:28.13,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What if someone finds out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:31.47,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Right. I'll be in big trouble \Nif anyone finds out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:35.15,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,So snack with me \Nand be my partner in crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.15,0:09:37.40,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,They're yummy, you know? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:38.31,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.31,0:09:40.26,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Say ahh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:44.94,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Wow! You look like a dog that \Nhates getting his teeth brushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:47.44,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Us Yamabukis stick to the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:49.71,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Says the guy who brought cough drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:52.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You don't need to do this. \NI won't rat you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:56.08,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why'd we even come to the library, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:59.12,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Oh, I took on some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:00.58,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'll need to use the copy machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:03.92,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I see. That's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.92,0:10:06.63,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Give me two-thirds of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.63,0:10:13.93,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}STUDENT COUNCIL\NFOR SPORTS DAY
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.92,0:10:11.28,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Doing this alone would take until dark... \Nfor an ordinary person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:16.12,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yours truly, however, \Ncan make light work of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:19.31,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Let's get this over with and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.70,0:10:21.04,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I know you're feeling under the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:26.46,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yamabuki-kun. \NYou're so dependable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:27.66,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.19,0:10:32.94,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I know I said you should rely on others, \Nbut you're also too passive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.94,0:10:36.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You should speak your mind more often, \Nat least with the broadcasting club.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:39.28,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm fine with the supporting role.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:42.79,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Like these little pieces of chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.41,0:10:47.63,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Even among snacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:51.05,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,there are stars and supporting roles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:52.76,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm the latter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:59.55,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Those three are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.10,0:11:04.80,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,They shine bright, and they want to fight \Nin a world where talent is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.35,0:11:09.71,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I want to help them shine even brighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.38,0:11:15.53,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That's why I'd rather put \Ntheir priorities first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.48,0:11:22.46,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,And they're so quirky that someone has \Nto be the glue to bring them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:23.45,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That I get.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.45,0:11:24.88,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:27.87,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Last year's sports day \Nwas a dumpster fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:30.93,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Nene-chan read names wrong on commentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:32.68,Broadcast Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,Dekakari-san's so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.68,0:11:34.80,Broadcast Flashback,SHIRATORI,0,0,0,,That's Oogari! "O-o-gari!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:37.20,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Iko-chan broke the equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:40.13,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,And Rikka-chan couldn't come \Nbecause she caught a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:41.89,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SORRY, I'M RUNNING A TEMPERATURE\NARE YOU OKAY? REST UP TODAY.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:41.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Those girls are hopeless!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.34,0:11:46.52,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I want to make sure \Neverything works out this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:50.52,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Especially since...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.53,0:11:53.47,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'll probably leave the club in the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.41,0:11:56.47,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What? You'll quit the club?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.47,0:11:58.68,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why? Are you transferring out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.68,0:12:02.49,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Nah. I just want to focus on my studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:05.89,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,My grades are pretty decent,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.89,0:12:09.00,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,but I'll need to do better \Nto get into a good college.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:12.76,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,The anchors on flagship stations
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.76,0:12:15.13,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,are all graduates from \Nprestigious colleges, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:19.55,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,They also have good language skills \Nor other talents to make them stand apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:24.75,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm just a regular girl, so I'll have \Nto start hitting the books soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:26.14,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:34.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You want to make some good memories \Nbefore you quit club for exam prep,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.95,0:12:40.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,so you'll stick to a backup role, \Nhelp the other three shine bright,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:42.99,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,and make sure this year's \Nsports day is a hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:46.08,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:49.31,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I didn't raise you to be such a wimp!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.31,0:12:51.46,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Since when are you my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:54.59,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why don't you try to make \Nall your wishes come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:58.67,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why not stay in the club, do what \Nyou want to do for sports day,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.67,0:13:00.75,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,and make some better memories that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.75,0:13:02.71,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Huh? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.71,0:13:06.31,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,They say a bird in the hand \Nis better than two in the bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.31,0:13:07.85,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Uzuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:11.69,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Who do you think the man before you is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.69,0:13:12.69,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Errand boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.69,0:13:14.72,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You all remember that title, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.11,0:13:21.60,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Never forget that you have \Nyours truly on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:24.35,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're worried about your studies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.35,0:13:26.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll tutor you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.46,0:13:28.85,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You can't speak your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:31.41,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll stand by you and back you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.38,0:13:35.48,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Anyone who chases two birds \Nbut catches neither
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:37.67,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,is either a fool or alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.35,0:13:40.47,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,And you aren't either of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:42.89,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Why are you willing to do so much for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:48.60,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I said I'd turn you all \Ninto professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:13:58.40,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I can't go losing you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:14:02.07,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Huh? Th-That came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.51,0:14:07.09,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Also, you seem to have the wrong idea, \Nbut you shine brightly yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.77,0:14:09.79,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Just as brightly as the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:13.04,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Th-That's not true...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.04,0:14:16.98,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Do you mean to doubt yours truly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:22.33,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.81,0:14:25.76,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Hearing you say that makes me \Nfeel so warm and fuzzy inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.75,0:14:29.96,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Do you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.96,0:14:32.54,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm good enough \Nto stand alongside them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:34.14,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.77,0:14:35.92,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:39.82,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You actually have something you \Nwant to do for sports day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.82,0:14:42.94,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You see everything through, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:46.24,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I have an idea I want to try out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.24,0:14:50.79,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Present it to the club. \NI'll write a script.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.79,0:14:52.79,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:55.02,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,A-Also, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:57.79,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Can you keep this between us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:14:59.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The fact that you've \Nbeen snacking in secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.71,0:15:01.09,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.47,0:15:04.25,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,How I have an inferiority complex,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:06.90,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,how I thought about leaving the club,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:10.11,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,or how I'm having you help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.07,0:15:12.27,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.10,0:15:15.31,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:16.94,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Hey, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.55,0:15:20.23,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We're partners in crime now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:22.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You keep your mouth shut, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.51,0:15:27.03,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You've got chocolate all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:29.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,This is pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.51,0:15:30.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:37.29,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:37.63,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.63,0:15:40.57,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'd like us to do this on sports day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:43.59,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING CLUB - CONFESSION\N PROXY CONFESSION SERVICE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.57,0:15:43.59,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I call it the proxy confession service.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.07,0:15:45.51,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.47,0:15:50.38,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I-I know it'll be a lot of work, \Nso feel free to say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.38,0:15:52.70,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hey, that sounds super fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.70,0:15:53.90,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's very innovative.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.90,0:15:55.06,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I love the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:56.46,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:15:58.00,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.00,0:16:00.17,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,What was a string phone, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.17,0:16:02.24,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It'd be a pain if our advisor \Nfound out, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.24,0:16:05.07,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It's just the kind of thing she hates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:09.95,Main,EPTITLEB,0,0,0,,{\an8}PARTNERS IN CRIME
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:14.33,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}RED TEAM - WHITE TEAM
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:15.80,Main,GIRL B,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:16.86,Main,GIRL C,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:19.79,Main,GIRL C,0,0,0,,Why's he faster than \Nthe guys on the sports teams?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:27.76,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun has finished \Nfirst in the race!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:30.54,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,The man is blessed \Nwith legs as swift as the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.54,0:16:32.30,Main,GIRL C,0,0,0,,Now he's doing commentary for himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:33.73,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.73,0:16:35.98,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Took you long enough! \NHow are there so many things to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.98,0:16:40.30,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Get used to it! The five of us are \Nhandling commentary for every competition!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:47.90,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The basketball match between \NClasses 1-A and 1-D will begin soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:51.87,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Players, assemble in the gym at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:54.83,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Phew. That's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.83,0:16:58.48,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Rikka, we're in the scavenger hunt next.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:17:00.17,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Who's commentating?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:02.61,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Uh, I think it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.11,0:17:07.91,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,Bear witness! This battle will \Nchange the course of history!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:12.17,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,And I, Yamabuki Arisu, am here to \Nkick it off with my bombastic voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.49,0:17:16.41,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,Now, let me hear your piercing war cries!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.41,0:17:17.76,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Damn, he's loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.76,0:17:20.06,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm getting second-hand embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.06,0:17:24.02,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,What will these girls \Nhave to find and borrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.65,0:17:24.02,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}PERSON YOU RELY ON MOST\NPERSON WHOSE VOICE YOU LIKE THE MOST
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:26.23,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,It won't be recorded \Non the balance sheets!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:29.37,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,This battle is sure to make \Nall tax accountants cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.63,0:17:31.42,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.48,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,And me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:33.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Uh, I need to commentate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:35.28,Main,RIKKAIKO,0,0,0,,Just come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:37.71,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,Why Yamabuki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.71,0:17:39.16,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,I'm so jelly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:41.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm surprised there's \Nso much demand for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:43.09,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What were your prompts?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.09,0:17:44.88,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We're dead last! Step on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:46.80,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Uh, that's not happening \Nwith the three of us holding hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.80,0:17:49.34,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,But they said we have to \Nmaintain contact the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:52.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,This will mean helping the enemy team,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.49,0:17:56.01,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,but yours truly hates \Nthe taste of defeat even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.31,0:17:58.33,Main,RIKKA; IKO,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.33,0:18:00.02,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,All they said was to \Nmaintain contact, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.02,0:18:02.02,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rawr!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.02,0:18:04.23,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Oi, is that even allowed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.23,0:18:05.98,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,How is he still so fast?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:11.59,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.59,0:18:13.49,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,Who gets so upset about second place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.05,0:18:16.47,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,What was written on your slip, Rikka?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.47,0:18:17.52,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Not telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.52,0:18:18.94,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You hyper meanie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:20.44,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Let me see!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.44,0:18:22.53,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Once you let me see yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.53,0:18:24.29,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Don't wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:26.25,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's Yamabuki-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:30.13,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Next up is the cavalry battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.13,0:18:33.28,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun, \Ntwo of the bases got injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.28,0:18:34.07,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.07,0:18:36.89,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,It's too bad. \NWe'll have to sit this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.89,0:18:37.97,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:40.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yamabukis never go down without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:41.72,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:46.31,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Next, we have the \Nsecond-year cavalry battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.31,0:18:49.12,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hey! Why am I part of the horse?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:52.60,Main,GIRL Z,0,0,0,,Blame yourself for gaining \Nthree kilos in a month, Nene!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.74,0:18:56.61,Main,GIRL Z,0,0,0,,Whoa! What are you two doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:18:58.81,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Yamabuki, what are you thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.81,0:19:00.08,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,Holy cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.08,0:19:03.33,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Hey, Yamabuki-kun, we can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.33,0:19:06.37,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I am the Red Hare, and you are Lu Bu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.37,0:19:07.83,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:14.25,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Be careful not to get hurt \Nand, uh... good luck, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.59,0:19:21.75,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Get your face outta my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.75,0:19:23.63,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,This is how a cavalry battle works!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.63,0:19:25.09,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Then look away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.09,0:19:25.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.96,0:19:28.46,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Because you're so close, \Nit's bringing back memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.46,0:19:29.39,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:31.94,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What? Obviously...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:36.65,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,the k-ki...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.15,0:19:40.03,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,ki-ki...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:39.46,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,They got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:43.69,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.69,0:19:46.37,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,S-Sorry. Do you have to get so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.37,0:19:48.18,Main,GIRL Z,0,0,0,,On to the next one, Nene.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:49.74,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Oh, r-right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.33,0:19:54.62,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I couldn't fully become a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.62,0:19:56.17,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm glad you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.09,0:20:01.55,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or have \Nthose two grown closer lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.55,0:20:05.06,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Ew, why do I even care? Cringe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:06.94,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,It's none of my business!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:08.05,Main,GIRL Z,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.05,0:20:10.06,Main,GIRL Y,0,0,0,,Damn it, Nene! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.95,0:20:13.12,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We'll now take a fifteen-minute break.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:16.99,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Please be sure to rehydrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.99,0:20:19.82,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,How I needed this break!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:21.68,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Everything's going well so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.68,0:20:24.10,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,But this is where it gets real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.10,0:20:28.13,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Right. We need to prep \Nfor the lunchtime broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:29.92,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It'll be a lovely event.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.37,0:20:32.09,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A proxy confession service, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.09,0:20:39.93,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP) | CONFESSION
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:45.43,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.53,0:20:39.02,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We set a string phone by the door for \Nstudents who want to confess something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:41.44,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Our club will listen to their confession
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.44,0:20:45.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,and broadcast it to the whole school \Nwhile keeping it anonymous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.99,0:20:49.87,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Although, we could have \Njust used anonymous letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.87,0:20:51.19,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That wouldn't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.84,0:20:56.57,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We have to listen to their voices \Nto maintain the spirit and emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.85,0:20:57.90,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:01.36,Main - Top,SIGN,0,0,0,,PROXY CONFESSION SERVICE
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:01.36,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I made flyers we can distribute \Nto students to promote the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:03.97,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wouldn't a schoolwide \Nannouncement work just as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:06.93,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,But that'd tip the teachers off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.93,0:21:11.58,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You know our school technically \Ndoesn't allow relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.58,0:21:14.09,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,So we'll have to spring it on them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.09,0:21:16.39,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,But won't they try to stop us either way?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.39,0:21:19.19,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Not when the students \Nare having a ball, they won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.19,0:21:20.61,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.61,0:21:23.40,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm the vice president \Nof the student council.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.40,0:21:25.18,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm the very picture of a model student!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.18,0:21:27.98,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're saying they'll overlook it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:30.21,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,How optimistic you are, vice president.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.30,0:21:35.44,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to give it a shot...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.78,0:21:39.19,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Get the whole crowd \Ninvolved in a big event.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:43.20,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,One I planned and led,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.58,0:21:46.95,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,and one that'd be a great memory \Nfor the broadcasting club.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:53.33,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.74,0:21:56.37,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,First, let's hand out those flyers \Nwithout the teachers finding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.95,0:21:59.42,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,What is this you don't want \Nthe teachers finding out about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:02.10,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Huh? L...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:03.68,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Lemon-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.68,0:22:06.97,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING CLUB ADVISOR\NANDO LEMON (27)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.00,0:22:06.97,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I told you, stop calling me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:09.97,Main,EPTITLEC SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}THE ADVISOR'S CALLED LEMON-CHAN
